RGB10 Max 2 — unofficial andr36oid port
========================================

This project is an independent, community-made port of andr36oid to the
Powkiddy RGB10 Max 2. It is not produced, endorsed or supported by the
andr36oid project, Powkiddy, Rockchip, Google or LineageOS.

Trademarks and names remain the property of their respective owners and are
used only to describe compatibility.

Nothing in this repository contains or distributes:

  - ROMs, BIOS/firmware images for games or consoles
  - proprietary vendor blobs extracted from commercial firmware
  - the official andr36oid SD flasher (GPL-3.0) or its source code

The image produced by scripts/build-rgb10max2-image.sh is derived from an
andr36oid base image that you download yourself and from the port files in
this repository. You are responsible for complying with the licenses of the
base image and of any files you add to it.

Device tree sources under dts/ are derived from Rockchip and mainline Linux
sources (GPL-2.0); their SPDX identifiers are preserved.

Everything else in this repository is licensed under GPL-3.0; see LICENSE.

